01:54:54,120 --> 01:54:55,410
Miss Ratched.

1549
01:55:46,240 --> 01:55:48,070
I can explain everything.

1550
01:55:49,080 --> 01:55:50,470
Please do, Billy.

1551
01:55:51,150 --> 01:55:52,580
Explain everything.

1552
01:55:56,580 --> 01:55:57,810
Everything?

1553
01:56:00,390 --> 01:56:01,910
Aren't you ashamed?

1554
01:56:04,960 --> 01:56:06,290
No, I'm not.

1555
01:56:17,040 --> 01:56:19,200
You know, Billy, what worries me is...

1556
01:56:19,280 --> 01:56:21,710
how your mother's going to take this.

1557
01:56:31,920 --> 01:56:33,180
Well, you...

1558
01:56:34,060 --> 01:56:35,650
don't have to...

1559
01:56:36,660 --> 01:56:38,390
tell her, Miss Ratched.

1560
01:56:40,160 --> 01:56:41,860
I don't have to tell her?

1561
01:56:43,230 --> 01:56:46,000
Your mother and I are old friends, you know that.

1562
01:56:55,450 --> 01:56:56,840
Please...

1563
01:56:57,910 --> 01:56:59,110
don't...

1564
01:57:00,250 --> 01:57:01,380
tell my mother.

1565
01:57:01,450 --> 01:57:03,160
Don't you think you should have thought of that

1566
01:57:03,160 --> 01:57:04,780
before you took that woman...

1567
01:57:04,860 --> 01:57:06,250
in that room?

1568
01:57:15,230 --> 01:57:16,530
No, no.

1569
01:57:22,570 --> 01:57:23,770
I didn't.

1570
01:57:23,910 --> 01:57:26,740
You mean, she dragged you in there by force?

1571
01:57:40,960 --> 01:57:42,260
She did.

1572
01:57:46,470 --> 01:57:48,130
Everybody did.

1573
01:57:48,500 --> 01:57:50,400
Everybody? Who did?

1574
01:57:51,770 --> 01:57:53,240
You tell me who did!

1575
01:58:13,990 --> 01:58:15,360
Murphy.

1576
01:58:19,730 --> 01:58:21,100
Miss Ratched...

1577
01:58:23,100 --> 01:58:24,000
please don't...

1578
01:58:24,070 --> 01:58:26,470
-Mr. Warren?  -tell my mother, please.

1579
01:58:26,770 --> 01:58:29,570
Would you see that the men are washed and ready for the day.

1580
01:58:29,640 --> 01:58:32,270
Miss Ratched, please...please...

1581
01:58:34,380 --> 01:58:35,810
-Mr. Washington?  -Yes?

1582
01:58:35,880 --> 01:58:38,180
-Put Billy in Dr. Spivey's office.  -No!

1583
01:58:38,950 --> 01:58:41,320
Stay with him till the doctor arrives.

1584
01:58:46,460 --> 01:58:48,590
Move it! Come on, Martini, get on!

1585
01:59:12,090 --> 01:59:15,520
Hey, that way, please. Please, gentlemen.

1586
01:59:15,760 --> 01:59:18,490
Let's go, come on. Come on, you guys. What is this?

1587
01:59:18,560 --> 01:59:19,690
Let's go.

1588
01:59:43,820 --> 01:59:45,690
Hey, what the hell is that?

1589
01:59:46,020 --> 01:59:48,420
McMurphy, what the hell are you doing?

1590
01:59:53,400 --> 01:59:56,490
Washington, to the day room! Lmmediately!

1591
02:00:07,480 --> 02:00:09,950
Put down those keys and nobody gets hurt.

1592
02:00:19,730 --> 02:00:23,060
Move away from the window and take that damn Chief with you.

1593
02:00:34,810 --> 02:00:36,400
Come on, let's go!

1594
02:00:45,620 --> 02:00:46,950
Let me through!

1595
02:00:47,590 --> 02:00:49,080
Let me through!

1596
02:00:59,600 --> 02:01:01,430
Out of the way, McMurphy!

1597
02:01:05,070 --> 02:01:06,100
Come on, clear it!

1598
02:01:06,170 --> 02:01:08,140
Get these people out of here!

1599
02:01:08,440 --> 02:01:09,540
Oh, Billy!

1600
02:01:09,710 --> 02:01:10,900
Will you guys clear the door?

1601
02:01:10,980 --> 02:01:13,810
Everybody out! Out! Everybody out!

1602
02:01:13,910 --> 02:01:15,380
Come on, goddammit!

1603
02:01:18,920 --> 02:01:20,410
Now calm down!

1604
02:01:20,990 --> 02:01:24,220
The best thing we can do is go on with our daily routine.

1605
02:01:24,330 --> 02:01:25,590
All right?

1606
02:01:33,170 --> 02:01:34,660
Don't! Mac!

1607
02:01:38,370 --> 02:01:39,860
Mac! No!

1608
02:02:19,850 --> 02:02:21,750
And the bets are placed.

1609
02:02:21,890 --> 02:02:25,050
There's one for Tabes, and Chessy, and Martini, and the dealer.

1610
02:02:25,120 --> 02:02:27,490
And a four to Tabes, and a six, and a nine...

1611
02:02:27,560 --> 02:02:29,690
and a ten to the dealer.

1612
02:02:29,760 --> 02:02:30,850
A nine?

1613
02:02:31,300 --> 02:02:32,960
What do you say, Tabes?

1614
02:02:33,370 --> 02:02:34,700
A dime a piece.

1615
02:02:35,230 --> 02:02:36,830
No? You stick.

1616
02:02:37,140 --> 02:02:39,260
-He sticks.  -He sticks with a four.

1617
02:02:41,570 --> 02:02:43,370
Chessy's going for the ride.

1618
02:02:43,710 --> 02:02:45,340
What does that mean?

1619
02:02:45,410 --> 02:02:47,400
He wants a hit. Yeah, and a big queen.

1620
02:02:47,480 --> 02:02:48,780
I think you're busted.

1621
02:02:48,850 --> 02:02:50,340
Buggered, not busted.

1622
02:02:50,420 --> 02:02:52,040
-Turn them over.  -Buggered.

1623
02:02:52,120 --> 02:02:53,180
And weep.

1624
02:02:53,390 --> 02:02:54,750
Hit me.

1625
02:02:55,790 --> 02:02:57,350
I think you're over.

1626
02:02:57,460 --> 02:02:58,980
-I know you're over.  -Hovno.

1627
02:02:59,060 --> 02:03:00,720
-That's a three.  -Hovno.

1628
02:03:13,110 --> 02:03:14,470
Mr. Sefelt?

1629
02:03:16,040 --> 02:03:17,810
Did everything go well?

1630
02:03:20,450 --> 02:03:21,910
That's very nice.

1631
02:03:22,250 --> 02:03:24,340
Now you feel better, don't you?

1632
02:03:24,850 --> 02:03:26,110
Yes, ma'am.

1633
02:03:33,060 --> 02:03:34,420
McMurphy is out.

1634
02:03:39,170 --> 02:03:41,000
McMurphy has escaped.

1635
02:03:42,240 --> 02:03:44,540
They were taking him through the tunnel.

1636
02:03:44,610 --> 02:03:47,230
He beat up two of the attendants and escaped.

1637
02:03:47,580 --> 02:03:49,130
McMurphy's upstairs.

1638
02:03:49,610 --> 02:03:51,130
Oh, no, no, no!

1639
02:03:51,350 --> 02:03:53,750
Jim, I'm telling you, McMurphy is upstairs...

1640
02:03:53,820 --> 02:03:55,580
and he's as meek as a lamb.

1641
02:03:55,650 --> 02:03:56,680
Really?

1642
02:03:56,850 --> 02:03:58,610
I mean, how do you know?

1643
02:03:59,660 --> 02:04:01,280
Jack Dunphy told me.

1644
02:04:01,720 --> 02:04:03,590
Jack Dunphy's full of shit!

1645
02:04:03,890 --> 02:04:05,480
Right! Right!

1646
02:05:58,350 --> 02:06:00,110
They said you escaped.

1647
02:06:02,120 --> 02:06:04,240
I knew you wouldn't leave without me.

1648
02:06:04,320 --> 02:06:05,880
I was waiting for you.

1649
02:06:07,090 --> 02:06:08,850
Now we can make it, Mac.

1650
02:06:09,420 --> 02:06:11,360
I feel big as a damn mountain.

1651
02:06:30,280 --> 02:06:31,540
Oh, no!

1652
02:07:03,110 --> 02:07:05,210
I'm not going without you, Mac.

1653
02:07:08,250 --> 02:07:10,480
I wouldn't leave you here this way.

1654
02:07:20,730 --> 02:07:22,320
You're coming with me.

1655
02:07:44,190 --> 02:07:46,460
Let's go!

